-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 4.5 kg (9 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 380 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  380  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">ARM_Leather_2</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ARM_Leather_2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ARM_Leather_2\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">ac71c753-c207-465c-b28b-c10f95ed0745</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:ac71c753-c207-465c-b28b-c10f95ed0745\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:ac71c753-c207-465c-b28b-c10f95ed0745\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Stealthy\" title=\"Stealthy\">Stealthy</a></dt><dd>Gain a +1 bonus to <a href=\"/wiki/Stealth\" title=\"Stealth\">Stealth Checks</a>.</dd></dl><dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Balance\" title=\"Balance\">Balance</a></dt><dd>Gain a +1 bonus to <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving throw\">Saving throws</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/23px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/34px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/45px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ability check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/23px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Ability checks</a></dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Sold by traders using the <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Armour_Trader_Table#Traders\" title=\"Magic Armour Trader Table\">levelled magic armour table</a> if the player is level 7 or above</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n\n<p><i>Regarding Balance:</i></p>\n<ul><li>The bonus to Dexterity ability checks from <b>Balance</b> does not appear on the character but is correctly added when rolled.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t<li class=\"gallerycaption\">Models</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 101.33333333333px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 99.333333333333px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Leather_Armour_%2B2_Human_Front_Model.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Body Type 1 Front Human\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Leather_Armour_%2B2_Human_Front_Model.webp/149px-Leather_Armour_%2B2_Human_Front_Model.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Leather_Armour_%2B2_Human_Front_Model.webp/223px-Leather_Armour_%2B2_Human_Front_Model.webp 1.5x, /w/images/9/9f/Leather_Armour_%2B2_Human_Front_Model.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Leather Armour +2 Human Front\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Leather_Armour_%2B2_Human_Front_Model.webp/149px-Leather_Armour_%2B2_Human_Front_Model.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"300\" class=